tests/steelmc_hashes.rs holds hashes of the biomes of a few chunks, copied from
SteelMC's steel-core/test_assets/biome_hashes.json at the same commit, and reads the
whole of that file from a clone of SteelMC where one is named. The hashes are of
values that SteelMC's extractor read out of the game.
